                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15123.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Brazilian Minister to
                            Mexico to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brazilian Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-03T18:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 3, 1915—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>600. Your 741, June 2, 1 p.m. The statement has been delivered to Foreign Office
                    about 1 p.m. for transmission to General Garza.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cardoso de Oliveira.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
